      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/newswatchplusph/status/1994291191937142823",
      "text": "NCRPO ON FULL ALERT FOR NOV. 30 RALLY\n\nUPDATE: Palace Press Officer Claire Castro says the Metro Manila police force is on full alert as of Friday, Nov. 28, for \"maximum police presence and proper deployment\" ahead of the second “Trillion Peso March” on Sunday, Nov. 30. \n\nShe said more than 15,000 police personnel will be deployed for the gathering. \n\nThe rally organizers said they aim to raise the stakes against corruption and political dynasties, but will not seek the resignation of President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. and Vice President Sara Duterte.",
