    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1994292528246403080",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1994292528246403080",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1994292528246403080",
      "text": "[7:17AM] #LagIbdExpWay\n#3MB\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nWe are still experiencing a rapid Vehicular movement from Kara inward Berger down to Secretariat and Emergency Centre.\nTraffic is a bit slow at Tollgate due to massive vehicular turning but faster moving ahead to Ikosi/7up all the way to Alapere.\nA bit steady approaching Ogudu due to bus stop activities.\nInward Ifako and Iyana Oworo is better.\n\nIt's also still moving rapidly connecting the Third mainland bridge en route Adekunle and Adeniji but I'm moving steadily at Adeniji through Ilubirin.\n\nThe return journey on the Third mainland bridge back to Tollgate and Berger is free.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@Sola_Giwa\n@OlalekanOki \n@trafficpalava \n@lagostraffic961",
